---
import BotanicalAccent from './BotanicalAccent.astro';
---

<section id="studio" class="studio botanical-zone" aria-labelledby="studio-title" data-botanical-reveal>
	<div class="page-width studio__layout">
		<div class="studio__statement">
			<p class="eyebrow">THE STUDIO</p>
			<h2 id="studio-title">Flowers can say what words cannot.</h2>
			<div class="studio__ornament" aria-hidden="true">
				<span></span>
				<svg viewBox="0 0 38 38" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
					<path class="studio__ornament-stem" pathLength="1" d="M19 35C18.5 33 18 30 18 28C18.2 25 19 23 19 21C19 18 19 16 19 14C18.9 11 19 8 19 5" />
					<path class="studio__ornament-leaf" pathLength="1" d="M18 28C10 29 6 24 5 16C13 16 18 20 18 28Z" />
					<path class="studio__ornament-vein" pathLength="1" d="M18 28C13 23 9 19 6 17" />
					<path class="studio__ornament-leaf" pathLength="1" d="M19 21C27 20 32 15 33 7C25 8 20 13 19 21Z" />
					<path class="studio__ornament-vein" pathLength="1" d="M19 21C24 16 28 11 32 8" />
					<path class="studio__ornament-leaf" pathLength="1" d="M19 14C13 13 9 9 10 3C16 4 20 8 19 14Z" />
					<path class="studio__ornament-vein" pathLength="1" d="M19 14C16 10 13 6 11 4" />
				</svg>
				<span></span>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="studio__copy">
			<p class="studio__lead">Some moments call for a soft, familiar touch. Others deserve a little colour and a lot of joy.</p>
			<p>From the gentle layers of a rose bouquet to the easy brightness of seasonal blooms, each style offers its own way to share a feeling. Explore the shapes, colours, and small details that make flowers so easy to remember.</p>
			<div class="studio__notes" aria-label="The collection’s character">
				<div><span>01</span><p>Colour with character</p></div>
				<div><span>02</span><p>Shape and softness</p></div>
				<div><span>03</span><p>A feeling in every bloom</p></div>
			</div>
			<a class="text-link" href="#collection">Return to the collection <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
		</div>
	</div>
	<BotanicalAccent side="right" />
</section>
